! F77 PROCESS-only fixture (fair wall-time peer of cpp_process.in).
! Same CELL / MATRIX / detector as geometry.txt (DPS solution 12).
! MATRIX takes a NEWMAT-format file (insulin_1.mat) — F77 does not accept
! inline A-matrix rows the way C++ CONTROL does.
! No AUTOINDEX / spot search — compare integration time only.
!
! Run from a work directory that contains insulin_1_001.img and insulin_1.mat
! (or via tools/bench_ipmosflm_perf.sh / CTest ipmosflm_perf).
HKLOUT PERF.mtz
GENFILE gen.dat
NEWMAT ins.mat
DIRECTORY .
TEMPLATE insulin_1_###.img
DISTANCE 160.0
WAVELENGTH 0.9790
PIXEL 0.0816 0.0816
BEAM 94.0 94.7
SEPARATION 0.57 0.57
MATRIX insulin_1.mat
CELL 78.190 78.190 78.190 90.0 90.0 90.0
SYMMETRY 197
MOSAIC 0.30
PROCESS 1 to 1 start 0.0 angle 1.0
GO
EXIT
